[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0010","text":"呼……\n多谢款待……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0020","text":"（距离下一个安排……还有不少时间……\n　稍微休息一下吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0030","text":"辛苦了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0040","text":"咦……？\n没有人吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0060","text":"啊……！\n在睡午觉呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0070","text":"……诶嘿嘿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0080","text":"……给你盖好被子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0090","text":"好好休息哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400200_03_0100","text":"…………"}]
